This catalogue's ingredient names, and the golden test lines in
testdata/ingredients/frozen.json, are derived from the New York Times
ingredient-phrase-tagger training snapshot (nyt-ingredients-snapshot-2015.csv,
https://github.com/nytimes/ingredient-phrase-tagger, commit
e414c2ca279f23c99c8338ceba00653d88d40dfe).

