Modifications: names were normalised, merged and counted by
tools/catalog/top_names.py; UK names, aisles, staples, pack notes and synonyms
were added by hand (src=agent-estimate). Golden lines were selected by
tools/pick-golden and relabelled per docs/parser-spec.md by
tools/nyt-to-golden. The upstream repository ships no NOTICE file; this file
records the attribution and the changes.
